cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lissr: Access, Download, Harmonize, and Merge LISS Panel Data"
authors:
  - family-names: "Bosch"
    name-particle: "van den"
    given-names: "Siard"
    email: "siardvandenbosch@me.com"
license: MIT
version: "1.4.1"
date-released: "2026-09-18"
repository-code: "https://github.com/siardv/lissr"
url: "https://siardv.github.io/lissr/"
abstract: >-
  lissr is an R package for programmatic access to the LISS Data Archive. It
  authenticates, browses, and downloads survey files, then harmonizes,
  validates, and merges longitudinal LISS waves with reproducible,
  recipe-driven YAML workflows that record provenance.
